			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">8.</p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><u>Termination of the Agreement</u>. The Board Director or the Company may terminate this agreement at any time for any reason. The Agreement hereunder shall automatically terminate upon the death of the Board Director. Any purported termination of the Board Director&#8217;s agreement by the Company or by the Board Director shall be communicated by written notice of termination to the other party hereto.</p>
