			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">The Company represents and warrants that this Agreement has been authorized by the Company and is a valid and binding agreement of the Company enforceable against it in accordance with its terms.</p>
