			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">The Board Director represents and warrants that he is not a party to any agreement or instrument which would prevent him from entering into or performing his duties under this Agreement.</p>
