			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">12.</p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><u>Fiduciary Duties.</u>&nbsp;The Board Director acknowledges and agrees that, in serving as a Board Member, the Board Director owes fiduciary duties of loyalty and care to the Company and its stockholders under applicable law. The Board Director shall discharge such duties in good faith, with the care that an ordinarily prudent person in a like position would exercise under similar circumstances, and in a manner that the Board Director reasonably believes to be in the best interests of the Company and its stockholders. The Board Director shall avoid self-dealing, conflicts of interest, or other actions that would violate such fiduciary duties and shall promptly disclose to the Board any actual or potential conflicts of interest of which the Board Director becomes aware.</p>
