			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">The obligations of the Company hereunder may not be assigned by the Company without the prior written consent of the Board Director. This Agreement shall be binding upon and be enforceable against the Company&#8217;s successors (including any direct or indirect successor by purchase, merger, consolidation, or otherwise to all or substantially all of the business and/or assets of the Company) and assigns and against the Board Director&#8217;s personal and legal representatives.</p>
