			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><u>Amendment or Modification; Waiver</u>. No provision of this Agreement may be amended or waived unless such amendment or waiver is agreed to in writing, signed by the Board and by a duly authorized officer of the Company. No waiver by any party hereto of any breach by another party hereto of any condition or provision of this Agreement to be performed by such other party shall be deemed a waiver of a similar or dissimilar condition or provision at the same time, any prior time or any subsequent time.</p>
